# Concerted Effort ({2}{W}{W}): creatures you control gain protection until end of turn from whatever a creature you control has
# protection from. Hexdrinker at level 8 or more has protection from everything (CR 702.16e), so at Bot2's upkeep (turn 6) the
# Savannah Lions gains it too and Bot2's Shock can't target it. Level 4 on turn 3 (protection from instants only) and level 9
# on turn 5, from the five Moxen.

